{"4467320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Edena: Echoes of Magic", "steam_appid": 4467320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight the Machines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/3164a86c353b33a8c58cbe598655c362.poster.avif?t=1774197310\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/3164a86c353b33a8c58cbe598655c362.webm?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/3164a86c353b33a8c58cbe598655c362.mp4?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Edena: Echoes of Magic</strong>, battle the mechanical forces that have conquered the world and suppressed magic. Fight alongside your robotic companions, defeat waves of enemies, level up, and collect powerful upgrades as you prepare for the machines’ ultimate creation waiting at the end of your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Your Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/223b4afdfb002820151fda89673787ab.poster.avif?t=1774197310\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/223b4afdfb002820151fda89673787ab.webm?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/223b4afdfb002820151fda89673787ab.mp4?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t fight alone. Free robotic companions imprisoned across the world and recruit them to join your team. Each companion has unique abilities that will strengthen your squad against the mechanical army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Enchantments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/e0ad7ba638cfcfb868a62edf1847df62.poster.avif?t=1774197310\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/e0ad7ba638cfcfb868a62edf1847df62.webm?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/e0ad7ba638cfcfb868a62edf1847df62.mp4?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edena can channel magic to empower her allies. Enchant your companions with elemental magic to transform their attacks and create powerful combinations capable of destroying the machines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and Cleanse the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/7c7bbc892037d97bacbc47756ff4050f.poster.avif?t=1774197310\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/7c7bbc892037d97bacbc47756ff4050f.webm?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/7c7bbc892037d97bacbc47756ff4050f.mp4?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture across the map to locate enemy camps. Clear areas controlled by machines, earn rewards, and discover new upgrades to strengthen your team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Accessible Roguelite</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Edena: Echoes of Magic</strong> is a roguelite designed to be accessible and forgiving. Experiment freely with companions, enchantments, and upgrades without heavy penalties for failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/d0d22cc891635d2d1bacd5993ca8238d.avif?t=1774197310\" width=800 height=360 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight the Machines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/3164a86c353b33a8c58cbe598655c362.poster.avif?t=1774197310\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/3164a86c353b33a8c58cbe598655c362.webm?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/3164a86c353b33a8c58cbe598655c362.mp4?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Edena: Echoes of Magic</strong>, battle the mechanical forces that have conquered the world and suppressed magic. Fight alongside your robotic companions, defeat waves of enemies, level up, and collect powerful upgrades as you prepare for the machines’ ultimate creation waiting at the end of your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Your Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/223b4afdfb002820151fda89673787ab.poster.avif?t=1774197310\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/223b4afdfb002820151fda89673787ab.webm?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/223b4afdfb002820151fda89673787ab.mp4?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t fight alone. Free robotic companions imprisoned across the world and recruit them to join your team. Each companion has unique abilities that will strengthen your squad against the mechanical army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Enchantments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/e0ad7ba638cfcfb868a62edf1847df62.poster.avif?t=1774197310\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/e0ad7ba638cfcfb868a62edf1847df62.webm?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/e0ad7ba638cfcfb868a62edf1847df62.mp4?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edena can channel magic to empower her allies. Enchant your companions with elemental magic to transform their attacks and create powerful combinations capable of destroying the machines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and Cleanse the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/7c7bbc892037d97bacbc47756ff4050f.poster.avif?t=1774197310\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/7c7bbc892037d97bacbc47756ff4050f.webm?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/7c7bbc892037d97bacbc47756ff4050f.mp4?t=1774197310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture across the map to locate enemy camps. Clear areas controlled by machines, earn rewards, and discover new upgrades to strengthen your team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Accessible Roguelite</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Edena: Echoes of Magic</strong> is a roguelite designed to be accessible and forgiving. Experiment freely with companions, enchantments, and upgrades without heavy penalties for failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/extras/d0d22cc891635d2d1bacd5993ca8238d.avif?t=1774197310\" width=800 height=360 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Edena: Echoes of Magic is a fantasy third-person shooter with roguelite elements. Level up, gain upgrades, enhance your abilities, and face evil mechanical lifeforms alongside your cute robotic companions.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/4acf25994008af151871a1e0ff9ccd40c3b9309e/header.jpg?t=1774197310", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/06b26ea337d3b020ea9c3f58870904e14863342b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774197310", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467320/06b26ea337d3b020ea9c3f58870904e14863342b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774197310", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Pr